  "solution": {
    "text": "Given equation is&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math><br />So, <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> are ordered pairs <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfying the equation."
